{"server":"tw","storyId":"act39side_level_act39side_st02","groupId":"act39side","stageId":"act39side_st02","title":"傾瀉腐朽的花","storyCode":"EP-ST-2","avgTag":"幕間","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act39side/level_act39side_st02.txt","sourceHash":"aaa4ab8eacd6fc6033153e871df8caf3474224895c868be261e93351e46be7e0","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"57_g8_oldcabin"},{"type":"narration","text":"太陽落了下去，鹽漠的晚上冷到所有人都在顫抖。\n大家翻遍了破落的船艙，才勉強找到了一些不知放了多久的鱗肉乾和一口破鍋。\n在仿生海龍的幫助下，鍋中終於有了一點熱氣。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"溫蒂","speakerId":"avgnew_400_weedy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"太冷了……之前那些碎木頭沒撐多久，就都已經燒完了，我讓小葉先來代替一下火盆吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"溫蒂","speakerId":"avgnew_400_weedy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只是本來它的加熱功能是用來暖手的，如果是烹煮食物的話，只能做到這種程度了……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"極境","speakerId":"avg_npc_450_1","isRemote":false,"text":"能吃到熱的已經很偉大了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"胡安娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1581_1","isRemote":false,"text":"食物和淡水都不多，就算省著吃，這些也只能撐個兩三天。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"胡安娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1581_1","isRemote":false,"text":"要是遇到雨雲，把集雨用的布袋放出去，大概還能再收回來一點水……但鹽漠裡的天氣向來難以預料。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊西多","speakerId":"avg_npc_1577_1","isRemote":false,"text":"外面噴發的那些蒸汽……不能當作水源嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"胡安娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1581_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那裡面混雜著鹽漠深處的微生物，人不能直接喝。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊西多","speakerId":"avg_npc_1577_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我可以過濾。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"胡安娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1581_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你先修復羅盤。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊西多","speakerId":"avg_npc_1577_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒂奇","speakerId":"avg_npc_1580_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈，我們先熬過今晚再說吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒂奇","speakerId":"avg_npc_1580_1","isRemote":false,"text":"鹽漠深處的夜晚可不是鬧著玩的，吃的本來就不夠，有人還受了傷，不好好保暖的話，小心睡著睡著人就再也醒不過來了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕斯卡拉","speakerId":"avg_4163_rosesa_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……真的……真的會再也醒不過來了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕斯卡拉","speakerId":"avg_4163_rosesa_1","isRemote":false,"text":"要是現在再遇上鹽鱗，我們可能真的就……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"極境","speakerId":"avg_npc_450_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒事，我可以發揮一下專長，先傳訊息給鹽鱗，就說我們來了，讓牠們準備乖乖受死。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕斯卡拉","speakerId":"avg_4163_rosesa_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……我真的不懂，你為什麼不管什麼時候都能這麼無所謂？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"溫蒂","speakerId":"avgnew_400_weedy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……忍忍吧，這個時候也就他會耍嘴皮子了……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"溫蒂","speakerId":"avgnew_400_weedy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，小心！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"似乎是壓過了一條骸骨，征服宣告號顛簸了起來，破鍋與裡面的食物一同被震飛。\n極境立刻跳起衝上前去接鍋，卻被燙得哀嚎。\n伊西多墊步上前，劍尖精準地穿過鍋的把手，這才勉強保住晚餐。\n一旁，仿生海龍的熱氣也消散了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"溫蒂","speakerId":"avgnew_400_weedy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"加熱功能……壞了，等我先修一下……！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕斯卡拉","speakerId":"avg_4163_rosesa_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嘶……嘶……好冷……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕斯卡拉","speakerId":"avg_4163_rosesa_1","isRemote":false,"text":"阿啾！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊西多","speakerId":"avg_npc_1577_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我可以煉些簡單的發熱物質，應該不會花太久……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"胡安娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1581_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那些材料用來修羅盤。取暖的事，我來想辦法。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕斯卡拉","speakerId":"avg_4163_rosesa_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……阿啾！……阿啾！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕斯卡拉","speakerId":"avg_4163_rosesa_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……姐姐，能不能再分我一些毯子，我人小，冷得快，真的快要凍死了……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"溫蒂","speakerId":"avgnew_400_weedy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒂奇","speakerId":"avg_npc_1580_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這種時候就別什麼你的我的了，都擠到一起！伊西多，別在那邊煩惱了，過來吧！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"極境","speakerId":"avg_npc_450_1","isRemote":false,"text":"能和我這樣的大帥哥擠在一起……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"極境","speakerId":"avg_npc_450_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔！毯子蓋到我的頭了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊西多","speakerId":"avg_npc_1577_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"38_g21_skystarry_L2"},{"type":"narration","text":"胡安娜擋在風口，帕斯卡拉被蒂奇包起來，只露出一張被擠成一團的臉。\n極境和溫蒂努力活動著僵硬的手指，好抓起食物送進嘴裡。\n伊西多想要轉身回到塑金台，但在拿起探針的那一刻，他意識到，自己凍僵的手指毫無用處。\n征服宣告號漫無目的地順風行駛著。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"57_g8_oldcabin"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕斯卡拉","speakerId":"avg_4163_rosesa_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呼……我們現在要往哪裡去？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊西多","speakerId":"avg_npc_1577_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不知道，往深處開吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕斯卡拉","speakerId":"avg_4163_rosesa_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕斯卡拉","speakerId":"avg_4163_rosesa_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不知道我們要去哪裡……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕斯卡拉","speakerId":"avg_4163_rosesa_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不知道那些臭念經的什麼時候會追上來……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕斯卡拉","speakerId":"avg_4163_rosesa_1","isRemote":false,"text":"也不知道這麼冷，我會不會就醒不過來了，或者是船又撞上什麼東西……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕斯卡拉","speakerId":"avg_4163_rosesa_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"極境","speakerId":"avg_npc_450_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……她怎麼突然變成這樣？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"極境","speakerId":"avg_npc_450_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她不是應該一開始就先搶一個最暖和的位置睡覺了嗎？說不定還會半夜搶走我們所有人的毯子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒂奇","speakerId":"avg_npc_1580_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她也就只是個剛過十歲的小丫頭。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"胡安娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1581_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"胡安娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1581_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她睡著了，還有點發燒，看看她的口袋裡有沒有什麼能用的草藥。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕斯卡拉","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"要是明天我就要死在這裡了……我還、我還想回去我原先的家再睡一覺……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕斯卡拉","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"大房子還在……我的床、我的被子、我的浴缸……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕斯卡拉","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"穿最好看的衣服，一套又一套……！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕斯卡拉","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"吃不完的食物，花不完的錢，我不用再……被人一腳踢出去……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕斯卡拉","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"被人踢好痛……從街這頭滾到街那頭，好痛……我只想回一趟家……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕斯卡拉","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我要過上好日子……！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕斯卡拉","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我不要死在……死在……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕斯卡拉","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"……呼……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕斯卡拉","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"極境","speakerId":"avg_npc_450_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"極境","speakerId":"avg_npc_450_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我沒想到這次居然會走到這麼危險的地步……抱歉，溫蒂，我不該輕易地讓你過來……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"溫蒂","speakerId":"avgnew_400_weedy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我既然來了，就是來幫你們的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"極境","speakerId":"avg_npc_450_1","isRemote":false,"text":"要是能平安回到羅德島，我就把我這個月的薪水都賠給你！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"溫蒂","speakerId":"avgnew_400_weedy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不用了，啊哈……我先休息了……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"極境","speakerId":"avg_npc_450_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"極境","speakerId":"avg_npc_450_1","isRemote":false,"text":"棘刺？你還在幹嘛？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊西多","speakerId":"avg_npc_1577_1","isRemote":false,"text":"修羅盤，不然我們連骸礁峽谷都開不出去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊西多","speakerId":"avg_npc_1577_1","isRemote":false,"text":"船上太顛簸了，我需要搭建足夠複雜的法術能量場來穩定心相原質，否則整個羅盤很有可能在我拆解它的那一刻就分崩離析了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊西多","speakerId":"avg_npc_1577_1","isRemote":false,"text":"即使能夠搭建出這樣的能量場，我也需要確保自己施術的手足夠穩，不會在進行物質重構的過程中出差錯……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊西多","speakerId":"avg_npc_1577_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果在心相原質內部刻印流體源石迴路的過程中手有一絲顫抖，都可能會廢掉整塊材料……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊西多","speakerId":"avg_npc_1577_1","isRemote":false,"text":"還有，極境，我也不確定明天我們是否能夠……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"極境","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"……呼……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"胡安娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1581_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看他那副樣子，應該是累壞了。今天他一直學著掌舵，之前沒做過這種事情吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊西多","speakerId":"avg_npc_1577_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……沒有，他之前只負責過通訊相關的工作。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"胡安娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1581_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你也坐過來一點吧，溫度還在下降，擠一擠會暖和一點。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"胡安娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1581_1","isRemote":false,"text":"小珍珠，你要不……？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒂奇","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒂奇","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"……夫人……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"胡安娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1581_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒂奇","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"……夫人……爸爸說你們出海……海真的是藍色的嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒂奇","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"爸爸，你們能帶我出海嗎？我覺得我長大了……我也能出海了……！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"胡安娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1581_1","isRemote":false,"text":"小珍珠？你這是……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"那是小時候蒂奇在自己懷裡聽到的故事。\n胡安娜把手放在蒂奇的額頭上，但現在她的額頭已經爬上了皺紋。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"胡安娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1581_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"胡安娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1581_1","isRemote":false,"text":"伊西多，蒂奇也發燒了，草藥還有剩下的嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊西多","speakerId":"avg_npc_1577_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我找找……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊西多","speakerId":"avg_npc_1577_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就這些。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"翻藥聲在船艙內響起，伴隨著睡夢中的人們沉重的呼吸聲。伊西多把鍋架在勉強修好的仿生海龍上，準備燒水熬藥。\n胡安娜看著船艙內部光禿禿的骨架，眼神柔和，像是想到很美妙的事。\n她把草藥丟進鍋子裡，因為船的顛簸，鍋子裡還發出了小小的，類似海浪的聲音。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"胡安娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1581_1","isRemote":false,"text":"伊西多，你見過海嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"胡安娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1581_1","isRemote":false,"text":"比天空還要湛藍的海洋，翻著乳白色泡沫的波浪，彷彿能直接劈向我的雲間閃電……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"胡安娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1581_1","isRemote":false,"text":"伊西多，要不要和我們一起出海？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"胡安娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1581_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你會是個很好的船長。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊西多","speakerId":"avg_npc_1577_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"在昏暗中，胡安娜的雙眼閃閃發光，骨架間，冰涼的星光透進來。\n他想要開口回答，但嘴張了張，最終還是沉默了下去。\n在他們逃來的方向，追兵的火光閃爍。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊西多","speakerId":"avg_npc_1577_1","isRemote":false,"text":"…………"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_ibbar"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西爾弗","speakerId":"avg_npc_1583_1","isRemote":false,"text":"帆布、鱗皮、大量的木材、黃金時代的遺物……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西爾弗","speakerId":"avg_npc_1583_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但幾乎完全沒有食物和水。你們確實是走投無路了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西爾弗","speakerId":"avg_npc_1583_1","isRemote":false,"text":"人總是這樣，非要到這種境地，才能明白秩序的可貴。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈維爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1579_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……或許吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西爾弗","speakerId":"avg_npc_1583_1","isRemote":false,"text":"對秩序的遵從為你們帶來了食物、清水與居所。別忘了這一點。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈維爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1579_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……我的人明白談判是什麼意思，他們會遵守定好的條款。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西爾弗","speakerId":"avg_npc_1583_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不錯，你會成為一個優秀的私掠首領。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西爾弗","speakerId":"avg_npc_1583_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在我的引導下。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西爾弗","speakerId":"avg_npc_1583_1","isRemote":false,"text":"把這些收繳來的物資清點入庫，那些強盜也要記錄他們的姓名，然後再帶去城鎮邊緣那幾間空著的房子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西爾弗","speakerId":"avg_npc_1583_1","isRemote":false,"text":"路上小心一點，別引起太多鎮民的注意。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"習武教士","speakerId":"avg_npc_1587_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西爾弗","speakerId":"avg_npc_1583_1","isRemote":false,"text":"還有他們設計的那艘能在鹽漠上行進的船，要完好無損地運回來，那是鎮子日後的希望。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"習武教士","speakerId":"avg_npc_1587_1","isRemote":false,"text":"知道了，西爾弗閣下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西爾弗","speakerId":"avg_npc_1583_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯。還有什麼要告訴我的嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"習武教士","speakerId":"avg_npc_1587_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"習武教士","speakerId":"avg_npc_1587_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們事後還是去找了執裁官閣下……但只找到他衣物的殘片。我幫您放在桌上了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西爾弗","speakerId":"avg_npc_1583_1","isRemote":false,"text":"知道了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西爾弗","speakerId":"avg_npc_1583_1","isRemote":false,"text":"後續的事務我會處理。你下去吧，讓我獨自安靜一下。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西爾弗","speakerId":"avg_npc_1583_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西爾弗","speakerId":"avg_npc_1583_1","isRemote":false,"text":"安納斯塔西奧，安納斯塔西奧……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西爾弗","speakerId":"avg_npc_1583_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我原以為你能拯救我們所有人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西爾弗","speakerId":"avg_npc_1583_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但你其實只在乎你自己，是嗎？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"破布上的黑灰弄髒了每天精心擦拭的桌面。西爾弗拿起破布，呆在原地。\n終於，他還是將那塊破布丟進了壁爐，然後擦拭起那張辦公桌。\n一如他每天清晨準時爬上鐘塔，凝視著這座歷經天災與人禍，卻仍屹立不倒的城鎮。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西爾弗","speakerId":"avg_npc_1583_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你不在乎這個國家，不在乎這座鎮子，不在乎這些人。所以你不會明白，安納斯塔西奧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西爾弗","speakerId":"avg_npc_1583_1","isRemote":false,"text":"伊比利亞……不論繁華的商港還是貧瘠的漁村，那些僥倖沒被海洋吞沒的聚落，沒有一座不在混亂中崩潰。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西爾弗","speakerId":"avg_npc_1583_1","isRemote":false,"text":"曾經的雅隆也是如此。是我把半生都投進了這裡，是我把它從同類相食的慘劇和慘無人道的暴政中拯救了出來……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西爾弗","speakerId":"avg_npc_1583_1","isRemote":false,"text":"現在也是我為它取得了能行走大地的鹽船，要將它從貧瘠的廢土中解放。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西爾弗","speakerId":"avg_npc_1583_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而你，安納斯塔西奧，你只看得見自己偏執而古板的信仰。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西爾弗","speakerId":"avg_npc_1583_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你永遠不屬於雅隆，你也永遠不會再干涉雅隆。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西爾弗","speakerId":"avg_npc_1583_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……我的，雅隆。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_ibbar"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西爾弗","speakerId":"avg_npc_1583_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……我看看，透過複雜的傳動結構，讓風力來驅動步足裝置行走……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西爾弗","speakerId":"avg_npc_1583_1","isRemote":false,"text":"原來他們從最開始就沒往陸行艦的方向去想。風力步行機……確實是天才般的想法。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西爾弗","speakerId":"avg_npc_1583_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可惜，那個阿戈爾女人，明明有如此才能……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西爾弗","speakerId":"avg_npc_1583_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只要打造個三五艘，再加上從海盜那裡繳獲的，就能把雅隆的居民都搬上去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西爾弗","speakerId":"avg_npc_1583_1","isRemote":false,"text":"幾十年了……終於不用再被困在這片養不活任何人的鹽漠。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西爾弗","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"嘖，哪裡來的怪風。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西爾弗","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"……怎麼回事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西爾弗","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"這屋子漏風了嗎，連火也點不起來。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"幾粒微小的火星從火柴頭濺起，轉瞬間又熄滅。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"他看見纖細的火苗在風中搖曳，忽明忽暗的光在黑暗中暈開。\n他的眼睛逐漸開始適應，周遭的事物一一在他的視野中浮現。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"然後，他看見一張臉。鹽一般蒼白的皮膚上，斑駁地掛著赤褐色的血跡，濕漉漉的頭髮像臟器的殘片般無力地垂蕩。\n那是一張死人的臉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西爾弗","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"……你……你……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西爾弗","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"……沒有人能在經歷過一場那樣的爆炸之後活下來……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西爾弗","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你是怎麼做到的？你、你是什麼東西？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安納斯塔西奧","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你初次見到我的時候，我也是受了傷，徒步穿越鹽漠來到了雅隆。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安納斯塔西奧","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"但你那時問我的，是我需不需要幫助。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安納斯塔西奧","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"那時的你，多麼渴望自己能幫到他人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西爾弗","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安納斯塔西奧","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"但現在呢？當你一次又一次地阻止教士們來救我，當你肆無忌憚地在內心想像我的死亡……你是在謀求什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安納斯塔西奧","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你也被欲望所腐化了，是嗎？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"沒有再說任何一句話，西爾弗癱倒下去。他似乎想抓住什麼，卻只是把抽屜拉了出來。\n花瓣從抽屜中傾瀉而下，埋住了西爾弗的半個身子。\n乾枯的花，腐敗的花，化作黑灰的花。幾年前的花，十幾年前的花，幾十年前的花。\n長久以來，鎮民們為表感謝，向他們的證裁官閣下送上的每一朵花，都在此刻傾瀉而下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安納斯塔西奧","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"……花？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_ibindoor"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"審判庭教士","speakerId":"avg_npc_1587_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你安全了，孩子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"審判庭教士","speakerId":"avg_npc_1587_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你母親發瘋了，但我們已經控制住她了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小安納斯塔西奧","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我、我……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"審判庭教士","speakerId":"avg_npc_1587_1","isRemote":false,"text":"天哪，他在吃什麼……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小安納斯塔西奧","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"不！不要！！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小安納斯塔西奧","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我、我……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小安納斯塔西奧","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我有罪……讓我死……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"審判庭教士","speakerId":"avg_npc_1587_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，孩子。你只是想活下去，我不該審判你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"審判庭教士","speakerId":"avg_npc_1587_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你的罪，該由你自己活著贖清。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"審判庭教士","speakerId":"avg_npc_1587_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有罪的人千千萬萬。我們行走大地，就是為了幫那些無力自己贖罪的人，為了祛除他們的罪孽。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"審判庭教士","speakerId":"avg_npc_1587_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你也可以這樣做，這樣才能贖清你自己的罪。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"審判庭教士","speakerId":"avg_npc_1587_1","isRemote":false,"text":"終有一日，最純潔的花朵……也會因你的觸摸而綻放。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[]}
